## Linux Boot Flow

Power On  
→ BIOS / UEFI  
→ Bootloader (GRUB)  
→ Linux Kernel Loads  
→ systemd starts (PID 1)  
→ Services & Processes Start

Example services:
- Docker
- SSH
- Kubernetes components
- Networking services

